type: software
title: bRMS Generator Researcher
abstract: >-
  Windows desktop application that generates breaking repeated masking
  suppression (bRMS) experiments for Green Lab at the Hebrew University of
  Jerusalem. It writes a JSON experiment file for a separate bRMS runner.
